{"id":"v06-03","volume":6,"volumeTitle":"卷六","volumeSubtitle":"汉文","index":3,"title":{"t":"景帝令二千石修職詔","s":"景帝令二千石修职诏"},"book":{"t":"西漢文","s":"西汉文"},"sourceHead":{"t":"","s":""},"author":"西汉","annotated":true,"paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"tr":"在器物上雕花刻镂，是妨害农事的；织造锦绣和彩色丝带，是妨害妇女纺织的。","tokens":[{"t":"雕","s":"雕","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"文","s":"文","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"刻","s":"刻","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"鏤","s":"镂","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"傷","s":"伤","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"農","s":"农","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"事","s":"事","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"者","s":"者","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"也","s":"也","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"錦","s":"锦","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"繡","s":"绣","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"纂","s":"纂","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"組","s":"组","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"害","s":"害","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"女","s":"女","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"紅","s":"红","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"者","s":"者","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"也","s":"也","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]},{"tr":"农事受到妨害，就是饥饿的根源；妇女的纺织受到妨害，就是受冻的根源。","tokens":[{"t":"農","s":"农","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"事","s":"事","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"傷","s":"伤","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"則","s":"则","py":"","ctx":